{"ID":"20240522082240-qa3ad2p","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082240-qa3ad2p","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082240-qa3ad2p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095818-gkys83s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095821-jpdpd1d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095818-d0nzy90\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:77,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:77\u0026#125;","title":"菲菲醫師的久咳醫案","type":"doc","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-gkys83s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-gkys83s","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"菲菲医师的经方临床使用案例报告--长期咳嗽"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-abwdtns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-abwdtns","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2009年10月3号 初诊"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-74670k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-74670k6","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美国人，女 ，52 岁，偏胖 ， 某西医诊所的办公室经理"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-8imypm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-8imypm9","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长年咳嗽，4—5 年了，每天都咳，无论白天或是晚上，咳嗽后头晕，大多数是干咳，有时有少量的痰，色白，脖子紧，头痛，不能入睡。鼻炎10年，多种方法治疗，未见明显疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-br1be4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-br1be4o","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问："}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-dmeas78","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-dmeas78","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-cpxk0rf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-cpxk0rf","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-2ucxjh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-2ucxjh0","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡不好，因为咳嗽，易入睡，醒后难以入睡，不能睡通宵"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-fvgqp6w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-fvgqp6w","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-h4ub5ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-h4ub5ys","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口好"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-q2ksdmt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-q2ksdmt","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-sar8k1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-sar8k1s","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双足温"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-9rcjpcw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-9rcjpcw","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-ergoyo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-ergoyo1","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便 每日行，每日一次"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-59gejgz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-59gejgz","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-w6zlseb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-w6zlseb","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴有，喜冰饮"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-ne62g5r","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-ne62g5r","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-o3tst17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-o3tst17","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便色中黄"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-64gik3j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-64gik3j","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-76319sm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-76319sm","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出汗有"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-mz7vfq3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-mz7vfq3","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-zojbneq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-zojbneq","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身多热，无盗汗"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-sa0re04","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OS4=","Num":9},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-sa0re04","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095818-4imfeyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-4imfeyv","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体力尚好"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-y3ciotw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-y3ciotw","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌诊：淡黄红"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-jc5wh1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-jc5wh1r","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉诊：缓有力"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-ivsnfhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-ivsnfhw","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方如下： 麻黃三钱，射干三钱，紫菀三钱，款冬花三钱，生姜三片，大枣10枚，半夏五钱，五味子五钱，细辛二钱，辛夷三钱，石菖蒲三钱，苍术三钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-yl66yao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-yl66yao","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮成三碗，早晚餐前各一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-qmqszqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-qmqszqg","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2009年10月10号复诊"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-vvmrt83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-vvmrt83","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2009年10月4号晚上开始服药。现在几乎不咳了，睡好转很多，无头晕，无头痛，鼻炎好很多。现在想开始减肥。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-xul7o6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-xul7o6z","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人对我说：“菲菲，我咳嗽了4—5年，吃你的药才不到一周就不咳了，有件事说起来真是难过，我在这个区最顶尖的肺科医生的诊所工作，但他却不能治好我的咳嗽。”我这才知道，她工作的地点是“ Pulmonary Care of xxxxxx,”。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-d0nzy90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-d0nzy90","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身在西医的地方工作，有着很好的保险，却自己从口袋掏钱看中医，可见她知道自己所看见的西医学能做多少了。此时想起倪师的话: “是医学的错误，而不是医生的错误”"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-depu6md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-depu6md","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学生菲菲报告完毕"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-7az51o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-7az51o4","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-hcfeivf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-hcfeivf","updated":"20240522095820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語 :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-b8x15s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-b8x15s1","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  光是一個簡單的咳嗽，西方醫學卻對之束手無策，無論是醫院開的有多大，醫療設備有多先進，無法治療就是無法治療，醫學沒有比看看誰的設備好，看誰的保險好，只有對與錯二種醫學而已，對與錯的醫學該如何去區分呢？很簡單，看誰把病治好，誰就是對的，讀者同意嗎？看看治病的結果，就可以一目暸然的知道，只有經方是正確的醫學，溫病派的中醫看到麻黃時，簡直如同是見到鬼一般，嚇到手軟，不要說是使用麻黃，根本就是連提都懶得提，因為從來沒用過啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-x7k18pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-x7k18pu","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     菲菲很優秀，在海外為我中華文化爭光，是一位優秀的中華兒女，真是很棒。繼續加油，為國爭光。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-iy2o4b3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-iy2o4b3","updated":"20240522095818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     猶記得老師上週才將一位親友的女兒，從被證實得到H1N1之前，就利用大青龍湯將之退燒，之後用麻杏甘石湯收尾，後來被西醫醫院也證實，病人沒有H1N1了，中醫所謂青龍指的就是麻黃，現在溫病派的中醫師卻視麻桂為蛇蠍，不敢使用，請問你們如何治病呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240522095818-7b3j0qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095818-7b3j0qi","updated":"20240522095826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年10月16日"}]},{"ID":"20240522095821-00qgvdt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522095821-00qgvdt"}},{"ID":"20240522095821-jpdpd1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095821-jpdpd1d"}}]}